 4. 👜 1 for the road: Rotisserie chic 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Walmart For National Chicken Month, Walmart released limited-edition rotisserie chicken purses in two "flavors," traditional and lemon pepper.

 The bags, priced at $5.97, sold out in less than a day — but Walmart hinted there are "more cooking." Walmart said it's playing into this fall's "oversized clutch trend" by giving one of its most "beloved deli items a fashionable twist." Read the announcement . 

 
 
